cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "A hybrid global-2D model for SF6/Ar inductively coupled plasma etchers with neural-network acceleration"
abstract: >-
  Model code, solver output and trained neural-network surrogate weights
  accompanying a study of a self-consistent hybrid global-2D model for SF6/Ar
  inductively coupled plasma etchers with neural-network surrogate acceleration.
  Source code is under MIT; the data and trained weights are under CC BY 4.0,
  except third-party-derived material listed in THIRD_PARTY_DATA.md.
